# Minion-Process kit sentinel (kit-onboard skill step E5). Shipped by bootstrap/install.ps1 to
# <root>/.codex/rules/. `minion-rules-sentinel` is not a real program: a normal Codex session that loads
# this project's rules folder refuses it by this rule instead of reporting an unknown command.
prefix_rule(
    pattern=["minion-rules-sentinel"],
    decision="forbidden",
    justification="kit-sentinel: project rules are loaded",
)
